  "name": "gitops-infrastructure",
  "description": "A GitOps-based orchestration framework for managing Mina Protocol infrastructure across multiple Kubernetes clusters using ArgoCD and Helm. The repository automates the lifecycle of blockchain components, including archival migrations, state dump procedures, and node deployments via a seeder-based application pattern. It incorporates a comprehensive CI/CD observability stack that extracts performance metrics from Buildkite and GitHub for long-term analysis in InfluxDB.",
